[L] (N_m * N_m)(c) = m^3 L_m(c), L_m(e) = sum_{d | gcd(m,e)} d^-1 prod_{p | m/d} (1 - p^-2)
  odd m in 1..209: 105 moduli, mismatches 0; even m in 2..210: 105 moduli, mismatches 0
  with one table multiplied by a unit u (u = 2..7 prime to m): mismatches 0
  L_(p^k)(e) = (1-p^-2) sigma(p^v)/p^v (v<k), 1 + 1/p - p^-(k+1) (v>=k): mismatches 0

